g Vandalia (1819-1839) which replaced Kaskaskia (1809-1818)\n- This is about Illinois, not Ohio\n\nThe documents don't contain verification that any town named \"WIZE\" or Springfields became capitals of Ohio - they simply identify WIZE as a radio station location in Springfield, Ohio.\n</task_result>","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_21bdf73eeffeGra6DhuJWY65uw","model":{"modelID":"qwen35-9b","providerID":"local"},"truncated":false},"title":"Find state capitals and Springfield history","time":{"start":1777648831501,"end":1777649208226}}}}
